      <a href="tel:+34616271011" class="flex min-h-11 items-center underline-offset-4 hover:underline">+34 616 27 10 11</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/drarekx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex min-h-11 items-center underline-offset-4 hover:underline">github.com/drarekx</a>
